Package: vdr-plugin-mcp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${vdr:Depends}, socat
Description: VDR plugin offering the SVDRP commands as MCP server
 Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for AI assistants like Claude. Every
 SVDRP command of VDR and of the loaded plugins becomes a tool, built at
 runtime from SVDRP HELP; further tools show the system log, read and set
 editing marks and regenerate the index of recordings.
 .
 Locally the server listens on 127.0.0.1, other machines connect through
 SSH and socat. Optionally it speaks MCP over HTTPS with API keys (read only
 or read/write) for clients without SSH. Commands can be hidden with a deny
 list (default DEL*,HITK).
